                        "translated_name": "But only disavowed and turned away;"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 5584,
                        "chapter_id": 75,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "33",
                        "arabic_name": "ثُمَّ ذَهَبَ إِلَىٰٓ أَهْلِهِۦ يَتَمَطَّىٰٓ",
                        "translated_name": "Then he strutted back to his people."
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 5585,
                        "chapter_id": 75,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "34",
                        "arabic_name": "أَوْلَىٰ لَكَ فَأَوْلَىٰ",
                        "translated_name": "Alas the woe for you, alas!"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 5586,
                        "chapter_id": 75,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "35",
                        "arabic_name": "ثُمَّ أَوْلَىٰ لَكَ فَأَوْلَىٰٓ",
                        "translated_name": "Alas, the woe for you!"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 5587,
                        "chapter_id": 75,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "36",
                        "arabic_name": "أَيَحْسَبُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ أَن يُتْرَكَ سُدًى",
                        "translated_name": "Does man think that he will be left alone to himself, free?"
                    },
