                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "38",
                        "arabic_name": "ثُمَّ كَانَ عَلَقَةً فَخَلَقَ فَسَوَّىٰ",
                        "translated_name": "Then formed into an embryo? Then He fashioned, shaped and proportioned"
                    },
